<P>
<!--
Pit Corner seating is one of our premiere passes, and consists of 2 similar
seating areas.  The larger Pit Corner area is shown in the first photo as the
red & white 'riser' area in the distance, at high center of the photograph.  This
area gives you an elevated view of the pit action along with an excellent view
of the race course.
-->
Pit Corner is one of our most exciting passes:

<P>
<CENTER>
<IMG SRC="pcorner2.gif" ALT="[Pit Corner Photo]" WIDTH=260 HEIGHT=135 ALIGN="MIDDLE">
<IMG SRC="pcorner1.gif" ALT="[Pit Corner Photo]" WIDTH=260 HEIGHT=135 ALIGN="MIDDLE">
</CENTER>

<CENTER>
<FONT SIZE=-1>
(Photos copyright Joe Pfeiffer)
</FONT>
</CENTER>

<P>
The Pit Corner area is located just feet from the edge of the Detroit
River and is favored by photographers.  The second photo helps you
find the Pit Corner bleachers in the first pic.
<!--
Starting in
1996, we've made this area more comfortable by replacing the bleachers with
100 theater style padded seats.
-->

<P>
